      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "\nconst posts = $('Helper: filter seen posts').first().json.posts || [], plan = $('Gate').first().json.plan;\nif (!posts.length) return [];\nlet notes = ''; try { notes = $('Helper: notes').first().json.notes || ''; } catch (e) {}\nconst prompt = `You help the owner (X account @your_x_handle) engage in a friendly, human way. Client notes:\\n${notes.slice(0, 4000)}\\n\nTopic of this round: ${plan.topic}. Recent X posts (JSON):\\n${JSON.stringify(posts.map(p => ({ url: p.url, handle: p.handle, text: String(p.text || '').slice(0, 600), age: p.age, likes: p.likes })), null, 0)}\\n\nPick at most 3 posts that are genuinely worth engaging with (skip politics, controversy, crypto, giveaways, engagement bait, ads, sales pitches, huge brand accounts, or anything off-topic).\nFor each pick ONE action, only from ${JSON.stringify(plan.allowed_actions || ['reply', 'repost'])}: \"reply\" (preferred: a short friendly comment)${(plan.allowed_actions || []).includes('like') ? ', \"like\"' : ''} or \"repost\" (at most one repost, only for a really useful post).\nReply rules: under 200 characters, 1-2 short sentences, mention one concrete detail from their post, sound like a real person texting (lowercase start ok), ask a real question or share a plain small tip/experience.\nNever: links, hashtags, @mentions, emojis, em dashes, pitching, products, offers, \"DM me\", \"check out\", generic praise like \"great post\"/\"love this\"/\"so true\", invented numbers or claims about clients.\nReturn ONLY a JSON array, no prose: [{\"url\": \"...\", \"action\": \"${(plan.allowed_actions || ['reply', 'repost']).join('|')}\", \"text\": \"comment text or empty for like/repost\", \"why\": \"max 12 words\"}]`;\nreturn [{ json: { prompt } }];\n"
      }
